# Shoalscan's policy files decide what fails a pull request. Require a review
# from the people who own security for every change to them. Copy these lines
# into .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the team name.

/.shoalscan.toml                     @your-org/security
/.shoalscan/                         @your-org/security
/security/rules/                     @your-org/security
/.github/workflows/shoalscan.yml     @your-org/security
